<title>PORTUGAL: TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ESTORIL, Portugal 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final</p>
<p>of the $625,000 Estoril Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>6-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat 7-Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-3 7-5</p>
</text>
